Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.07,0:00:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.43,0:00:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.97,0:01:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, this is getting ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.05,0:01:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been like 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's taking the driver so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.43,0:01:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's not like we have all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.41,0:01:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we should go check on the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.83,0:01:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like business isn't exactly booming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.61,0:01:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.95,0:01:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nobody here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.63,0:01:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.09,0:01:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look like\Nthe safest place to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.07,0:01:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not in the little boy's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.73,0:01:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then where'd he go? Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.25,0:01:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Joey? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.45,0:01:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you listening to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.23,0:01:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, do you guys hear that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.31,0:01:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.43,0:01:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,All I hear is my stomach growling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.31,0:02:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Joey's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.29,0:02:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.77,0:02:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're getting closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.35,0:02:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever it is, we gotta flag them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's just hope\Nthe natives are friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.87,0:02:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, I got a feeling they're\Nnot here to rescue us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.69,0:02:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,you kids shouldn't be roaming around these
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.17,0:02:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,parts yeah you never\Nknow who might drive by
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.45,0:02:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,hey you guys got a problem gas\Nstation's closed so just move on yuki
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.81,0:02:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,what's wrong pharaoh this looks\Ndangerous let me take over
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.51,0:02:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,what do you guys want anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.85,0:02:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you to get lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe they're\Ntaking your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.09,0:03:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the spiky-haired\Nkid's the smart one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.03,0:03:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I just got a great idea, guys. Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.23,0:03:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh and his pals are ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.41,0:03:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll never outrun our choppers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.55,0:03:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.97,0:03:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.47,0:03:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, guess they're not fighting fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.93,0:03:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Good guess, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.01,0:03:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's rock and roll, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.73,0:03:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.77,0:04:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.23,0:04:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec. Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.09,0:04:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's ask questions later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.95,0:04:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.85,0:04:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.89,0:04:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Going my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.41,0:04:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.03,0:04:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.15,0:04:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.71,0:04:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.47,0:05:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! My!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.29,0:05:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So wait, who just saved us? Mai did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.05,0:05:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.49,0:05:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You serious? Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.07,0:05:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone out there likes to crash parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.43,0:05:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find out who.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.31,0:05:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.73,0:05:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know just where she's going, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How could Alistair just\Ndisappear like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.93,0:06:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, and frankly, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.61,0:06:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, aren't you worried\Nhe'll come back for revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.27,0:06:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to pay for your father's crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.29,0:06:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,By giving up your soul? You heard him\N- he has the power to steal souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.13,0:06:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,come on you believe that nonsense\Nalistair was just a desperate loony
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,who wanted a shot at beating a real\Nduelist he didn't have any magic
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.53,0:06:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,powers mokuba but seto that oricalco's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.05,0:06:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,thing seemed pretty real to me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.13,0:06:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,that had to be a trick but what i don't\Nget is how this card got in my deck
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:07:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be hallucinating!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.47,0:07:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you have been chosen\Nto release the mighty Critias!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.25,0:07:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm just about ready\Nto wake up from this dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.37,0:07:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now join forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.33,0:07:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything to shut you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.69,0:07:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is one of the most\Npowerful cards I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.29,0:07:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where it came from, but\NI have to find out more about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's only one person who\Nwould have that kind of information.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.77,0:07:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The real Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.29,0:07:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, there's an email from HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.47,0:07:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They need us to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.97,0:07:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the president of this company,\Nand I'll decide what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.95,0:08:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And right now, we need to\Npay a visit to Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.25,0:08:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiating navigation system.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.13,0:08:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Activating rear thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.05,0:08:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting force for Industrial\NIllusions Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.65,0:08:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So the car overheated, sue me. Do\Nus a favor from now on: let a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.31,0:08:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,do the driving huh that way we\Nwon't get left high and dry in a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.11,0:08:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,desert next time hey if you hadn't\Ntaken your sweet time getting
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.75,0:08:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,in i wouldn't have to drive so fast\Nand the car would have been fine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.49,0:08:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so it's my fault we're walking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.09,0:08:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you agree, Wheeler. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.47,0:08:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya is right, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.33,0:09:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not the time to be\Nfighting one another. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What we need now is a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.69,0:09:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The first thing we need\Nto do is locate Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.45,0:09:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, seems like whoever's\Nafter Pegasus knows we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And I bet they got to him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So we have to be really careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.69,0:09:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.21,0:09:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now phase two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.51,0:09:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we get there without a car?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.55,0:09:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.89,0:09:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope it's not more bikers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.95,0:09:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is much better than the limo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.17,0:09:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No one thinks you're funny, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.07,0:10:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to be on the road again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm still confused\Nabout what happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.89,0:10:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You said Mai helped us out back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do you know it was her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's easy, Paya. Her car.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.03,0:10:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,She was carrying Hoppy Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.65,0:10:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mai's trademark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.61,0:10:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take that. Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.87,0:10:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, I got a glimpse of\Nher through her helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.45,0:10:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew we'd run into her someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.95,0:10:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And did you see how she took\Ncare of those biker creeps?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.39,0:10:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it makes me glad she's on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.44,0:10:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But something's bugging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't she stick around?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.11,0:10:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this day get any worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been stuffed in a smelly gym bag,\Ndumped off in the worst part of town,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and used as a trampoline\Nby a bunch of street punks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.97,0:11:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.15,0:11:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Things can't get any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.25,0:11:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.47,0:11:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My wallet! Our money!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.59,0:11:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.21,0:11:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Like he's gonna listen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.73,0:11:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,See, he did listen
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, I think this belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.51,0:11:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you guys know Yugi, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.99,0:11:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, this is pretty wild I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,what are the odds I'd run into two of\NYugi's friends in my neck of the woods?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.33,0:11:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,His friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.79,0:11:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You are his friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.19,0:11:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, Jose! Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.33,0:11:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We're best friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta love that Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.27,0:11:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Work with me here, Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.73,0:11:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be our big break.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.13,0:12:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can tell me\Nif the rumors are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Word on the street is Yugi lost all\Nthree of his Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.99,0:12:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to tell you, Duke,\Nbut the rumors are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,A bunch of hooligans swiped\Nhim right after the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.71,0:12:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really quite a shame, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.79,0:12:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Cards as strong as those\Nfalling into the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So we flew all the way to San Francisco\Nto try and help our bestest pal,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.63,0:12:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, get his Egyptian god cards back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.79,0:12:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We heard Maximilian Pegasus might have\Nsome information about where to find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.43,0:12:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.99,0:12:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, what kind of friends would\Nwe be if we didn't lend a hand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.47,0:12:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Next stop, Industrial\NIllusions Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.13,0:12:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.15,0:12:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.61,0:12:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The place is completely empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.97,0:12:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe it's like some\Nkind of holiday or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.23,0:12:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why were the front\Ndoors left wide open?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.65,0:12:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.91,0:13:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.41,0:13:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.77,0:13:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I suspect the thieves that were after\NPegasus may have already found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.09,0:13:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And if that's the case, I'm\Nsure they're expecting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.61,0:13:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, the phones aren't working
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.59,0:13:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, we're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.41,0:13:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,These things won't budge. We've\Nbeen tricked. Oh, man, not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.01,0:13:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.99,0:13:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like we're not alone
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.59,0:13:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.85,0:14:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.67,0:14:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to say I told you so, but I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.71,0:14:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,As for you, what brings\Nyou to San Francisco, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The trolleys?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.67,0:14:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.87,0:14:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't we get a high?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.33,0:14:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the silent treatment, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.65,0:14:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not my.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.23,0:14:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,At least not the my you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.25,0:14:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.09,0:14:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.01,0:14:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did you get past my security?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess your office isn't as secure\Nas you think it is, moneybags.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.35,0:14:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.71,0:14:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.61,0:14:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.71,0:14:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:15:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to duel you,\Nand to take your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.47,0:15:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.69,0:15:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have 100 life points left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.27,0:15:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for long. My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.03,0:15:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought it was fun to steal people's\Nsouls in Duelist Kingdom, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.31,0:15:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now it's time for\Nme to have a little fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate harpy lady phoenix formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.79,0:15:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I have six harpies, it lets me\Ndestroy up to six of your monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.29,0:15:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to my magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.67,0:15:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the sum of your monster's attack points\Ngets subtracted from your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.55,0:15:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.09,0:16:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.61,0:16:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to Pegasus. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.61,0:16:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, is that really him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.81,0:16:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you do that to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.15,0:16:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you better start\Nparking, or else what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your little reunion with Mai not\Ngo as well as you expected it to?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.53,0:16:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, why are you keeping\Nthese guys all for yourself, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.69,0:16:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you show some manners\Nand share the fun with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.01,0:16:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business, you lackey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.33,0:16:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,These geeks are mine,\Nso deal with it. Geeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.07,0:16:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're your friends, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.59,0:16:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to say anything, Mushy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.07,0:16:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What you did for me\Nback there said it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:17:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, my favorite thing about this\Nentire tournament was that I got to know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.89,0:17:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.49,0:17:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Right back at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.49,0:17:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Mai, tell me this is all a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.61,0:17:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on our side, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.25,0:17:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai totally sold us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I would never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.33,0:17:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him, you're still our friend, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.73,0:17:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to explain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I was never a part of\Nyour little playgroup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.03,0:17:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'm gonna break\Nyou apart one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And Wheeler, I'm starting with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.99,0:17:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's payback time, and it all starts now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And to think, I was once pathetic\Nenough to call you my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.71,0:17:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I know the truth, you were\Nholding me back from achieving true power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.15,0:17:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,so say hello to my real\Nfriend the seal of ori kalpos
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,this card's done more for me\Nthan you losers ever could
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.83,0:18:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,no not this
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.47,0:18:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're scared now, just wait\Ntill you lose. Wake up, my this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.19,0:18:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,thing's nothing but bad news it's\Nmessing up your head big time
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you remember everything\Nwe've been through together just
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.15,0:18:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,ditch that freaky card and things\Ncan be the way they used to be
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.51,0:18:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,uh my
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.29,0:18:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's exactly as I feared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.65,0:18:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The Aurichalcos controls her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.15,0:18:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel must end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.07,0:19:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, she's gonna do the same\Nthing to Joey that she did to Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.23,0:19:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.67,0:19:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he'll win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.81,0:19:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My, let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be another\Nway to settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.35,0:19:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.49,0:19:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Harpy Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.33,0:19:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as my magic card is in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.33,0:19:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,every one of my monsters\Nfalls under its control,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.27,0:19:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,giving them 500 extra attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.23,0:19:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.97,0:19:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's gonna get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.09,0:19:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever loses the duel loses their soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.15,0:19:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lose you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.63,0:19:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta stop this duel now!
